2026-11-13T03:13:20.1384703Z #!/usr/bin/env python3
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1385326Z """Frozen D2/D3/D4 content-defect re-probe over the committed bundle family.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1385790Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1385876Z Why this exists
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1386079Z ---------------
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1386402Z Direction v68 ordered work item (2) asks the product to *publish* a per-bundle
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1386878Z and per-class histogram of the frozen D2/D3/D4 content predicates over the
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1387360Z flagship offline/server slice family, together with the false-reject count on
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1387820Z the confirmed set, instead of restating the result as prose in
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1388252Z ``state/product.json``.  Until this module existed the only statement of that
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1388623Z result was the narrative line
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1388774Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1389142Z     "All 4 offline slice bundles and the server slice bundle regenerated with
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1389514Z      the fix show correct downgrades"
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1389691Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1389888Z which no committed instrument re-derived.  This module is that instrument.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1390170Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1390305Z What it measures (and what it deliberately does not)
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1390643Z ----------------------------------------------------
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1391032Z For every committed ``*.bundle.json`` under ``results/product/offline_slice/``
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1391503Z and ``results/product/server_slice/`` it applies the product's own frozen
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1391998Z content predicates (``product.query.counter_evidence_span.frozen_content_defects``)
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1392493Z to every row that is still ``counter_evidence_verified is True`` and counts the
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1392931Z defect classes that survive on the *shipped* (post-filter) bytes.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1393189Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1393418Z * ``fixed_path_family`` — bundles whose provenance carries
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1393842Z   ``provenance.counter_evidence_span.content_filter``, i.e. bundles that were
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1394774Z   regenerated on the fixed path.  This family is *identified from the bytes*,
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1395242Z   never hard-coded, so a future regeneration is picked up automatically.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1395771Z * ``all_committed`` — every committed bundle, including historical ones that
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1396241Z   predate the fix.  Historical defects are preserved evidence, not a defect of
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1396893Z   the current head; both populations are published side by side so the two are
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1397439Z   never conflated.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1398003Z * ``before_after`` — for the four decisions the accepted FAST-MVP falsifier
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1398723Z   measured as verified-but-defective, the seam's own per-row downgrade records
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1399408Z   on the fixed path are paired with the historical verified verdict: same
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1399886Z   decision, BEFORE verified+defective, AFTER unevidenced with a reason code.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1400558Z   The confirmed sound row is re-checked in the same pass.  No historical
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1400929Z   bundle is rewritten or deleted.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1401374Z * ``packet_v3_reemission`` — the frozen packet-of-record v3 bytes are hashed,
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1401839Z   deep-copied, and re-run through the current baseline and guarded arms.  The
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1402292Z   accepted arm artifact is pinned by sha256 and compared side by side on
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1402751Z   emitted / verified / abstained / support-among-emitted / yield.  Because v3
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1403226Z   carries no *verified defective incumbent*, the v68 rejection leg is expected
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1403713Z   to downgrade zero rows there; that no-op and the one content-clean verbatim
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1404462Z   guarded emission are published explicitly rather than hidden.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1404721Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1404919Z It imports the frozen predicate constants verbatim through the accepted
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1405409Z ``counter_evidence_span`` module and re-publishes their provenance hashes.  It
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1405899Z NEVER re-derives, re-tunes or edits the frozen gate, rubric, threshold or bar,
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1406372Z it never runs the evaluation scorer and it makes no serve/admission claim.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1406651Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1406735Z Claim ceiling
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1406943Z -------------
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1407249Z Reported-only measurement of committed bytes under the frozen content
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1407704Z predicates.  It says nothing about legal usefulness, nothing about a frozen
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1408175Z scorer's emission predicate (factory-wide requirement 26 keeps those families
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1408614Z separate), and nothing about bundles outside this repository.
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1408974Z 
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1409051Z Usage
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1409227Z -----
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1409492Z     python3 product/content_family_probe.py --run-id 40143042888
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1409866Z     python3 product/content_family_probe.py --json
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1410263Z     python3 product/content_family_probe.py --check     # exit 1 when unmet
2026-11-13T03:13:20.1410609Z """
