2026-11-13T03:16:02.2312568Z """Progressive query execution: first-page map, background expansion, job server.
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2312951Z 
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2313211Z Offline and deterministic (frozen OpenCaseLaw envelopes + fixture generation).
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2313588Z 
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2313828Z The defect these tests pin (measured live, run 38665681083): ``/api/query/start``
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2314604Z blocked **136.79 s** before the first point was drawn and ``/api/query/enrich`` a
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2315179Z further **150.70 s**, so the human-gate session began with ~2.3 minutes of empty
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2315662Z page.  The contract now is:
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2315848Z 
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2316057Z * one bounded upstream page -> a complete, valid map (seconds);
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2316615Z * the wider multi-channel retrieval runs as a background job and patches that
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2317149Z   map without moving a single point that was already rendered;
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2317664Z * generation + counter-authority run as a second job the browser polls;
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2318240Z * a double-click cannot start two model runs, and the server answers while they
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2318672Z   run.
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2318896Z """
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2319109Z import json
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2319337Z import sys
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2319561Z import threading
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2319798Z import time
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2320027Z import urllib.error
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2320281Z import urllib.parse
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2320574Z import urllib.request
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2320843Z from pathlib import Path
2026-11-13T03:16:02.2321265Z 
